msgstr "Two sites, or a partner connected by VPN, using the same range cannot communicate properly. Renumber one of the networks, or set up address translation, then fix the address plan."

msgid "Associez chaque VLAN à son réseau IP (onglet VLAN du réseau, ou plan d'adressage) pour que le schéma réseau reste complet."
msgstr "Link each VLAN to its IP network (VLAN tab of the network, or address plan) so that the network diagram stays complete."

